    {
      "id": "C01",
      "type": "technical",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "统一教学伪代码（yield* 传递事件流）\nasync function* queryLoop(s) {\n  for (;;) {\n    s.signal.throwIfAborted();\n    const out = yield* streamModelEvents(buildApiView(s), {\n      signal:s.signal, onSafeToolReady:startSafeToolsEarly,\n    });\n    const d = await classify(out, s);\n    if (d.kind === \"continue\") {\n      await d.prepare(); continue;\n    }\n    if (d.kind === \"done\") return; else throw d.finalError;\n  }\n}",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 682,
      "height": 220,
      "padding": 5,
      "fontFamily": "SFMono-Regular",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "minFontSize": 12,
      "fontWeight": 550,
      "lineHeight": 1,
      "align": "left",
      "appearance": "tone-light"
    },
    {
      "id": "BND",
      "type": "technical",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "四条边界\n\n① API stop_reason ≠ 运行时 continuation reason\n\n② StreamingToolExecutor 是第 ② 步的侧车，不是第八种原因\n\n③ 恢复闸门控制错误传播，不是新的原因\n\n④ 提前执行也要等下一轮才能发送 tool_result",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 770,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 406,
      "height": 214,
      "padding": 12,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 15,
